    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. that makes sense. another thing though—we're really worried about the \"hand-off\" points. sometimes stuff goes missing or the packaging gets tampered with during the transfer between carriers. what kind of security or physical integrity checks should we have in place to make sure nothing's interfering with the cargo during those transitions?",
