      "content": "Implement tamper-evident seals on all primary and secondary packaging layers, ensuring these seals are uniquely identifiable and require specific logging upon breaking. At every hand-off point, conduct a documented physical inspection, verifying the seal integrity and container condition against the shipping manifest. Utilize specialized security protocols, potentially involving GPS tracking and geofencing for high-value transfers, to monitor the cargo's location and movement in real-time. Establish a formal chain of custody log, requiring signatures from authorized personnel at every transfer stage to ensure accountability.",
